    demo:excerpt "Fictional scheme criteria: Locally registered business; At least one employee; Workforce development project; Applicant co-funding ≥ 20%. Benefit: Up to S$12,000 workforce training credit · fictional. Required illustrative evidence: Business registration record, Workforce training plan, Project proposal and co-funding plan. All criteria must pass; documentary verification and officer review are required." ;
    demo:persona "businesses" ;
    demo:source "Synthetic policy catalogue v2 · scheme-workforce-lift" ;
    demo:updatedAt "2026-10-08T09:00:00+08:00" .

